title: "SAI Deal Radar — AI-agent-native opportunity radar"
abstract: >
  A continuously-refreshed, source-cited list of real AI/ML, business-succession,
  property-relocation and venture opportunities sourced worldwide. ARM-classified,
  impact-ranked and evolved via EvoForge + EvoSkillOpt over an accumulated
  EvoMetaClaw trajectory. Published as HTML, JSON, RSS, llms.txt and a
  /.well-known/agents.json manifest so classic search and AI agents can both
  discover and reason about every deal.
